        "slc_e88d0fd14952e5d128d9a0f083d1b58443b3eaa42a3bc29c90bcf7699dec2171"
      ],
      "text": "Display is configurable: token counts, cost estimates, source filtering (Claude/Codex), and the menu bar icon can be toggled."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_858c27e5d26e29cb26e3c4d4e3d6b4447c406d960950758b337e6c5540a1110f",
